                                "sense_id": "846ebbbe-2eba-33a7-abb7-f6edd1f4c380",
                                "text": "...that he looked quite like a gentleman bound on a shooting expedition, and that his friends had every reason to think he would now be snowproof."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "94d08b90-3d86-4576-9a6d-baa5c52304dc",
                                "sense_id": "846ebbbe-2eba-33a7-abb7-f6edd1f4c380",
                                "text": "Care should be taken to make windows rain- and snowproof, and to allow opening for ventilation without letting in rain during ordinary storms."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "691b7f11-cc84-4932-b8b8-00a8b1dcc9c0",
                                "sense_id": "846ebbbe-2eba-33a7-abb7-f6edd1f4c380",
                                "text": "Make a Snow Angel. What You Need: Snow (deep enough to flop into), your body (preferably covered in snowproof clothes)."
                            }
                        ]
